Value Filldown PROCESS_ID (\d+)
Value NEIGHBOR_ID (\S+)
Value PRIORITY (\d+)
Value STATE (\S+)
Value DEAD_TIME (\S+)
Value ADDRESS (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)

Start
  ^OSPF process ${PROCESS_ID}:\s*$$
  ^${NEIGHBOR_ID}\s+${PRIORITY}\s+${STATE}\s+${DEAD_TIME}\s+${ADDRESS}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record

EOF
